sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as mcp-lifecycle-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MCPPod as MCP Server Pod<br/>configurable/TCP
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>configurable/TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,MCPPod: Flow 1: MCPServer Reconciliation
        User->>API: Create/Update MCPServer CR<br/>Auth: User RBAC
        API->>Webhook: POST /validate-mcp-x-k8s-io-v1alpha1-mcpserver<br/>443 → 9443/TCP, TLS (cert-manager)
        Webhook-->>API: Admit / Reject<br/>(image allowlist, digest, labels)
        API->>Operator: Watch notification<br/>HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
        Operator->>API: Create Deployment, Service,<br/>NetworkPolicy, MCPGatewayBinding<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        Operator->>MCPPod: MCP protocol handshake<br/>(initialize via go-sdk)<br/>HTTP or HTTPS, TLS 1.2+ configurable
        MCPPod-->>Operator: Handshake response<br/>(server capabilities)
        Operator->>API: Update MCPServer status<br/>Verified condition + server address
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Operator,GW: Flow 2: Gateway Exposure (HTTPRoute)
        Operator->>API: Create MCPGatewayBinding<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        API->>Operator: MCPGatewayBinding watch event
        Operator->>API: Create HTTPRoute<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
        Note over GW: External client → Gateway<br/>→ HTTPRoute → MCP server pod
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Webhook,API: Flow 3: API Version Conversion
        API->>Webhook: POST /convert<br/>443 → 9443/TCP, TLS (cert-manager)
        Webhook-->>API: Converted MCPServer<br/>(v1alpha1 ↔ v1beta1)
    end

    rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
        Note over Prom,Operator: Metrics Scraping
        Prom->>Operator: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
        Operator-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    end
